 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・品種: 湿った土では侵略的になりうると明記。NC State・種も攻撃的に広がるとする（走出枝による）。おぎはら・品種は「性質は穏やかでゆっくり」と逆なので中。剪定不要",
  "management_type_quote": "can be invasive in moist soils",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": null,
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/種] Avoid overhead watering and thin plants periodically to promote good air circulation, particularly if plants have experienced problems with leaf blight.\n[NC State/種] If pachysandra has experienced problems with leaf blight, plant thinning is recommended to promote good air circulation.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: North-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
